    "title": "Happy Father's Day - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrea McElroy ,\n22 hours ago In my Mother’s Day column a few weeks ago, I shared a bit about my childhood. Growing up, I always knew I wanted to be a momma and a wife. I dreamed about the family I would one day build. But what I didn’t realize back then was how much my definition of a “good family” was shaped by the man who raised me. Read full article",
